Meta.NoCommercialUsage=False
Meta.ConfigVersion=8
Meta.ReleaseNotes=USA 852 baseline: AMP starts and stops only the native PangYa service tree. The lifecycle synchronizes safe AMP configuration fragments once, resolves the public DDNS address once at start, and updates only the advertised IPv4 fields.
